# UI-GHOST-1: the placement ghost's four states through the real window, from the sim's own verdict
# (World::check_build_record through PlayRunner::request_build_probe), on the lan5 developer island.
# Run with ANNO_DEV_GOODS_TONS=3: the pioneer house 501 (cost wood 3 t, data/ui/construction.txt
# public (0,0)) is affordable exactly once. Tiles: (1140, 516) and (1156, 516) are the free land the
# other construction scripts build on; (1148, 536) is the inlet south of them (island heights
# below 16 under the whole 4 x 4 footprint 1146..1149 x 534..537, N_256X256_0002_2B.SCP).
# (950, 600) is the build panel's chrome at 1024 x 768. The screenshots feed ghost_pixel_check.py.
resize 1024 768
wait frames 5
look 1148 522
key b
wait frames 5
click_px 833 330
wait frames 5
expect title build 501
# valid: free own land, the stock pays: the building and the yellow radius outline
hover-land 1140 516
wait fact tool.ghost == valid
wait frames 3
expect fact tool.ghost.pixels > 0
screenshot ghost_valid
# refused: the inlet; the yellow footprint outline only
hover-land 1148 536
wait fact tool.ghost == refused
wait frames 3
expect fact tool.ghost.pixels > 0
screenshot ghost_refused
# hidden: the pointer on the panel's chrome hides the ghost and its outline (HE-observed, OQ-757)
hover_px 950 600
wait fact tool.ghost == hidden
wait frames 3
expect fact tool.ghost.pixels == 0
screenshot ghost_hidden
# the one affordable house is built: the stock is empty afterwards (wood 0)
click 1156 516
wait outcome
expect outcome Applied
# unaffordable: the same free tile as before now blinks; the phase flips both ways
hover-land 1140 516
wait fact tool.ghost == unaffordable
wait fact tool.ghost.phase == 1
expect fact tool.ghost == unaffordable
wait fact tool.ghost.phase == 0
expect fact tool.ghost == unaffordable
expect fact tool.ghost.pixels > 0
# the refused site stays refused with an empty stock (the site test comes first)
hover-land 1148 536
wait fact tool.ghost == refused
quit
